{
    "title": "iHeart: Music, Radio, Podcasts",
    "description": "Your Music, Your Stations, And #1 For Podcasts. All Free.\r\n\r\nListen to thousands of live radio stations and stream unlimited music playlists for any mood or activity. Play ad-free music and enjoy a wide selection of global hits. Stream songs, trending podcasts, and live sports for free on any device, including Wear OS.\r\n\r\nPlay sports radio stations and follow along the NFL 2024 season. Browse local AM and FM radio stations and stay up to date through live sports discussions. Connect with radio hosts on our Talkback mic and catch up on the NBA, NHL or MLB. Fox Sports, ESPN Radio and so much more \u2014 stream the stations you know and love.\r\n\r\nStream podcasts that are enjoyed across the nation and find what you need to listen in on hot topics. Dateline, Crime Junkie, Stuff You Should Know, Gimlet, or the Bobby Bones Show \u2014 browse our podcast library for genres that interest you. Listen to The Herd with Colin Cowherd or NPR and discuss your favorite topics with podcast hosts.\r\n\r\nDiscover new music on live radio stations and start your day off right with global hits of any genre. Find new artists through curated playlists or listen to songs on demand. Country, Pop, Hip Hop, R&B, Rock \u2014 enjoy a selection of millions of songs from any genre through our radio and music app.\r\n\r\nDive into the sounds, podcasts, and stations that shape you. Download iHeartRadio for free today!\r\n\r\niHeartRadio Features\r\n\r\nTHE BEST LIVE & LOCAL RADIO STATIONS\r\n\u2022 Live AM and FM radio stations \u2013 discover thousands of local and global favorites\r\n\u2022 Enjoy radio stations covering all topics, including news, sports, music & comedy\r\n\u2022 Trending music on free radio broadcasts \u2013 save hit stations with ease\r\n\u2022 Stream songs, listen offline & play music of any genre with national radio stations\r\n\u2022 Local radio stations \u2013 stay up to date on breaking news relevant for you\r\n\r\nLIVE SPORTS STATIONS\r\n\u2022 ESPN Radio, Fox Sports Radio & FNTSY Sports Radio \u2013 tune in to live sports with ease\r\n\u2022 Listen to sports radio stations & news discussions from top radio personalities\r\n\u2022 NFL 2024 season \u2013 catch up the latest games, commentary & standings\r\n\u2022 Sports news \u2013 follow the NFL, NBA, NHL, NCAA, MLB, Soccer, Golf, Tennis & more\r\n\u2022 Talk to your favorite hosts and enjoy sports news, highlights & commentary\r\n\r\nPODCASTS & TRENDING SHOWS\r\n\u2022 Play podcasts and adjust the playback speed\r\n\u2022 Listen to songs from the Top 100 Chart \u2013 refreshed every Monday\r\n\u2022 Trending podcasts await from ESPN, NPR, Gimlet, How Stuff Works, Black Effect, TED, Wondery & Big Money Players Network\r\n\u2022 Versatile podcast library \u2013 Dateline, Crime Junkie, Morbid, On Purpose with Jay Shetty, The Dan Bongino Show & more\r\n\r\nFREE MUSIC & PLAYLISTS\r\n\u2022 Music playlists & songs curated for you \u2013 organized by mood, activity, decade & genre\r\n\u2022 Enjoy \u2018Your Weekly Mixtape\u201d with new music every Monday\r\n\u2022 Discover song charts and listen offline with Pop, Country, Hip Hop, R&B & Rock\r\n\u2022 Personalized music stations \u2013 curated listening based on your favorite artists\r\n\u2022 Ad-free music from genres like Alternative, Folk, Gospel, Christian, Dance, Indie & more\r\n\r\nPREMIUM FEATURES\r\nListen ads-free and enjoy the benefits of iHeartRadio Plus\u2122 and iHeartRadio All Access\u2122.\r\n\u2022 Ad-free songs on demand \u2013 search and play any song, album & playlist\r\n\u2022 Offline music app \u2013 save & replay any song from the radio or download playlists\r\n\u2022 Create playlists that suit your mood & enjoy unlimited skips\r\n\u2022 Versatile listening \u2013 switch between your phone, tablet, Chromecast or Wear OS\r\n\r\n\u2014\r\n\r\nJoin our community!\r\n\u2022 Facebook: http://on.fb.me/1F1TcFX\r\n\u2022 Instagram: http://bit.ly/1e1AOUS\r\n\u2022 Twitter: http://bit.ly/1HZk5KQ\r\n\u2022 Blog: http://bit.ly/1GiT59D\r\n\r\nFor Feedback and Help\r\nTell us how we can improve by sharing your thoughts at help.iheart.com\r\n\r\niheart.com/terms\r\niheart.com/privacy\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2024 iHeartMedia, Inc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your Music, Your Stations, And #1 For Podcasts. All Free.<br><br>Listen to thousands of live radio stations and stream unlimited music playlists for any mood or activity. Play ad-free music and enjoy a wide selection of global hits. Stream songs, trending podcasts, and live sports for free on any device, including Wear OS.<br><br>Play sports radio stations and follow along the NFL 2024 season. Browse local AM and FM radio stations and stay up to date through live sports discussions. Connect with radio hosts on our Talkback mic and catch up on the NBA, NHL or MLB. Fox Sports, ESPN Radio and so much more \u2014 stream the stations you know and love.<br><br>Stream podcasts that are enjoyed across the nation and find what you need to listen in on hot topics. Dateline, Crime Junkie, Stuff You Should Know, Gimlet, or the Bobby Bones Show \u2014 browse our podcast library for genres that interest you. Listen to The Herd with Colin Cowherd or NPR and discuss your favorite topics with podcast hosts.<br><br>Discover new music on live radio stations and start your day off right with global hits of any genre. Find new artists through curated playlists or listen to songs on demand. Country, Pop, Hip Hop, R&amp;B, Rock \u2014 enjoy a selection of millions of songs from any genre through our radio and music app.<br><br>Dive into the sounds, podcasts, and stations that shape you. Download iHeartRadio for free today!<br><br>iHeartRadio Features<br><br>THE BEST LIVE &amp; LOCAL RADIO STATIONS<br>\u2022 Live AM and FM radio stations \u2013 discover thousands of local and global favorites<br>\u2022 Enjoy radio stations covering all topics, including news, sports, music &amp; comedy<br>\u2022 Trending music on free radio broadcasts \u2013 save hit stations with ease<br>\u2022 Stream songs, listen offline &amp; play music of any genre with national radio stations<br>\u2022 Local radio stations \u2013 stay up to date on breaking news relevant for you<br><br>LIVE SPORTS STATIONS<br>\u2022 ESPN Radio, Fox Sports Radio &amp; FNTSY Sports Radio \u2013 tune in to live sports with ease<br>\u2022 Listen to sports radio stations &amp; news discussions from top radio personalities<br>\u2022 NFL 2024 season \u2013 catch up the latest games, commentary &amp; standings<br>\u2022 Sports news \u2013 follow the NFL, NBA, NHL, NCAA, MLB, Soccer, Golf, Tennis &amp; more<br>\u2022 Talk to your favorite hosts and enjoy sports news, highlights &amp; commentary<br><br>PODCASTS &amp; TRENDING SHOWS<br>\u2022 Play podcasts and adjust the playback speed<br>\u2022 Listen to songs from the Top 100 Chart \u2013 refreshed every Monday<br>\u2022 Trending podcasts await from ESPN, NPR, Gimlet, How Stuff Works, Black Effect, TED, Wondery &amp; Big Money Players Network<br>\u2022 Versatile podcast library \u2013 Dateline, Crime Junkie, Morbid, On Purpose with Jay Shetty, The Dan Bongino Show &amp; more<br><br>FREE MUSIC &amp; PLAYLISTS<br>\u2022 Music playlists &amp; songs curated for you \u2013 organized by mood, activity, decade &amp; genre<br>\u2022 Enjoy \u2018Your Weekly Mixtape\u201d with new music every Monday<br>\u2022 Discover song charts and listen offline with Pop, Country, Hip Hop, R&amp;B &amp; Rock<br>\u2022 Personalized music stations \u2013 curated listening based on your favorite artists<br>\u2022 Ad-free music from genres like Alternative, Folk, Gospel, Christian, Dance, Indie &amp; more<br><br>PREMIUM FEATURES<br>Listen ads-free and enjoy the benefits of iHeartRadio Plus\u2122 and iHeartRadio All Access\u2122.<br>\u2022 Ad-free songs on demand \u2013 search and play any song, album &amp; playlist<br>\u2022 Offline music app \u2013 save &amp; replay any song from the radio or download playlists<br>\u2022 Create playlists that suit your mood &amp; enjoy unlimited skips<br>\u2022 Versatile listening \u2013 switch between your phone, tablet, Chromecast or Wear OS<br><br>\u2014<br><br>Join our community!<br>\u2022 Facebook: http://on.fb.me/1F1TcFX<br>\u2022 Instagram: http://bit.ly/1e1AOUS<br>\u2022 Twitter: http://bit.ly/1HZk5KQ<br>\u2022 Blog: http://bit.ly/1GiT59D<br><br>For Feedback and Help<br>Tell us how we can improve by sharing your thoughts at help.iheart.com<br><br>iheart.com/terms<br>iheart.com/privacy<br><br>\u00a9 2024 iHeartMedia, Inc.",
